{
  "name": "wavedrom-gui-vscode",
  "displayName": "WaveDrom-Gui",
  "description": "在 Markdown 预览中渲染 ```wavedrom 代码块与内嵌 WaveJSON 的图片（现代主题），并一键进入可视化编辑器，编辑结果写回原文件。",
  "version": "0.1.8",
  "publisher": "wavedrom-gui",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://cnb.cool/linshi-2026/wavedrom-gui"
  },
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.70.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Other",
    "Visualization"
  ],
  "activationEvents": [
    "onLanguage:markdown"
  ],
  "main": "./extension.js",
  "contributes": {
    "markdown.markdownItPlugins": true,
    "markdown.previewScripts": [
      "./media/modern-render.browser.js",
      "./media/preview.js"
    ],
    "markdown.previewStyles": [
      "./media/preview.css"
    ],
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "wavedrom-gui.editActive",
        "title": "WaveDrom: 编辑当前 Markdown 中的图表",
        "category": "WaveDrom"
      }
    ],
    "configuration": {
      "title": "WaveDrom-Gui",
      "properties": {
        "wavedrom-gui.previewEditAffordance": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "button",
            "block"
          ],
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "波形右上角显示一个铅笔图标按钮（默认）",
            "不显示按钮，点击波形任意位置即进入编辑"
          ],
          "default": "button",
          "markdownDescription": "Markdown 预览中进入可视化编辑器的入口形式。改完若预览没变，重开一次预览（Ctrl+Shift+V）即可。"
        },
        "wavedrom-gui.editorPanelPosition": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "current",
            "beside",
            "below",
            "newWindow"
          ],
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "在当前聚焦的编辑栏里作标签页（默认）——从预览点「编辑」时即与预览同栏，不新增分栏",
            "在编辑区右侧新开一栏（VS Code 的默认行为）",
            "在当前栏下方新开一栏，与该栏成上下关系——从预览点「编辑」即预览在上、编辑器在下",
            "编辑器搬到独立的窗口（VS Code 的「移动编辑器到新窗口」）"
          ],
          "default": "current",
          "markdownDescription": "可视化编辑面板打开的位置。无法做到「浮在预览窗口之上」：VS Code 未向扩展开放浮动/模态编辑器（`ViewColumn` 只有 Active / Beside / 1-9）。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node scripts/build.js",
    "test": "node test/run.js",
    "vscode:prepublish": "npm run build"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "markdown-it": "^15.0.1"
  }
}
